   "FamilySync.test_c4_shaders_never_dither": "Red on 6a58487 only at its last gl_FragCoord assertion: the set of functions that read gl_FragCoord is {screenUV} there, {screenUV, screenSign} now, because screenSign() (C6) did not exist yet. Every no-dither assertion holds on 6a58487: no TDDither, no dither/random/noise-seed names, no fract(sin()), lattice hashes only in valueNoise() and latticeSlope(), no gl_FragCoord in the demo TOPs. Nothing dithered.",
   "FamilySync.test_r5_vertex_decides_a_zero_normal_before_transforming": "Since the verifier round (V1) it also checks that the rest-normal fallback in flowNormal() is relative to the nudge's rest area; red on 6a58487 either way.",
